# USER's list box (seg35/36/38/43 port) in apps/lbtest's three lists; no real-3.11 reference (the
# program is libw16's own), so the lists' state is checked against what USER's code does:
# A (multicolumn, extended selection): click item 1, Shift+click 9, Ctrl+click 14, Right (14 -> 20,
#   one column), Shift+Right (20..26, the columns scroll so 26's column shows: top 12, scroll bar
#   at 100), Ctrl+/ selects everything.
# B (horizontal extent 520): click 3, Right x3 scrolls 3 average widths (24 px, bar at 9 of 100),
#   click 5 (WM_LBTRACKPOINT answered 1: nothing happens), click 4 twice (answered 2: the second
#   click is no double click, nothing is selected).
# C (owner-draw, no strings, sorted by WM_COMPAREITEM): click 2, Shift+Down (2..3), F3 (WM_VKEYTOITEM
#   answers item 2), "m" (WM_CHARTOITEM answers 9: mango; top 3), F2 (answered -2).
# The "ini:" values below are what USER's code gives (worked through by hand from the decode; the
# screenshots were checked by eye). WM_LBTRACKPOINT reaches the parent for every click on an item
# (8 here), the last one C's item 2 at (36,45); WM_VKEYTOITEM comes for Shift too (4 keys).
# regress: sh apps/lbtest/tests/lbtest.sh "$TEST" "$OUT"
# ini: LBTEST.INI A selcount=30
# ini: LBTEST.INI A caret=26
# ini: LBTEST.INI A anchor=20
# ini: LBTEST.INI A top=12
# ini: LBTEST.INI A hbar=1
# ini: LBTEST.INI A hpos=100
# ini: LBTEST.INI A rect1=0,-160,16,-80,32
# ini: LBTEST.INI B sel=3
# ini: LBTEST.INI B hpos=9
# ini: LBTEST.INI B rect1=1,0,16,268,32
# ini: LBTEST.INI C sel=9
# ini: LBTEST.INI C caret=9
# ini: LBTEST.INI C top=3
# ini: LBTEST.INI C vpos=33
# ini: LBTEST.INI events selchangeA=6
# ini: LBTEST.INI events selchangeB=1
# ini: LBTEST.INI events dblclkB=0
# ini: LBTEST.INI events selchangeC=4
# ini: LBTEST.INI events track=8,103,2,36,45
# ini: LBTEST.INI events vkey=4,113,9
# ini: LBTEST.INI events chartoitem=1,109
# ini: LBTEST.INI events cfind=1
# ini: LBTEST.INI events ctext=8,apple
sleep 300
click 34 67
click 114 99 shift
click 194 83 ctrl
sleep 200
shot shots/01-a-sel.png
key right
key shift+right
sleep 200
shot shots/02-a-scroll.png
key ctrl+slash
click 354 99
key right
key right
key right
sleep 200
shot shots/03-b-hext.png
click 354 131
click 354 115
click 354 115
click 60 268
key shift+down
key f3
type m
key f2
sleep 300
shot shots/04-c.png
quit
